// C30: hex.count_bits flips its dst's bits 4 and 5 above the hex value (dst+dbit+4/5) while dst is armed with an
// inline 64-op table: a move inside that table, the same under the block base - the word must stay pinned.
stl.startup
    hex.count_bits 2, n, x
    hex.print_as_digit 2, n, 0
    stl.loop
x:  hex.vec 2, 0xb7
n:  hex.vec 2, 0
